{"seq":1,"slug":"design-system-accessibility","title":"设计系统无障碍：在组件库层面构建可访问的基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-engineering/organization/design-system-accessibility","wordCount":733,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"设计系统无障碍-在组件库层面构建可访问的基础\">设计系统无障碍：在组件库层面构建可访问的基础</h1><p>设计系统是无障碍工程的杠杆点。一个无障碍的组件库可以让所有基于它构建的应用自动获得无障碍基线；反之，一个有无障碍缺陷的组件库会将这些缺陷传播到整个产品。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>设计系统的无障碍目标是：让<strong>正确的使用方式成为默认选项</strong>，让<strong>错误的使用方式难以发生</strong>。实现路径是：提供正确的默认值、将必要的属性设为 required 类型、通过 TypeScript 类型系统在编译时拦截错误用法、并为每个组件配套 jest-axe 测试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设计系统无障碍的责任分层\">设计系统无障碍的责任分层</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Design[设计系统层] --&gt; API[无障碍 API 设计]&#10;    Design --&gt; Token[颜色 Token 对比度]&#10;    Design --&gt; Test[组件级 jest-axe 测试]&#10;    Design --&gt; Docs[无障碍文档]&#10;&#10;    App[应用层] --&gt; Consume[正确消费设计系统]&#10;    App --&gt; Context[提供上下文无障碍名称]&#10;    App --&gt; A11yTest[页面级无障碍测试]&#10;&#10;    Design --&gt;|杠杆效应| App&#10;    App --&gt;|反馈| Design\">graph TD\n    Design[设计系统层] --&gt; API[无障碍 API 设计]\n    Design --&gt; Token[颜色 Token 对比度]\n    Design --&gt; Test[组件级 jest-axe 测试]\n    Design --&gt; Docs[无障碍文档]\n\n    App[应用层] --&gt; Consume[正确消费设计系统]\n    App --&gt; Context[提供上下文无障碍名称]\n    App --&gt; A11yTest[页面级无障碍测试]\n\n    Design --&gt;|杠杆效应| App\n    App --&gt;|反馈| Design</pre><h2 id=\"无障碍-api-设计原则\">无障碍 API 设计原则</h2><h3 id=\"原则一-正确的默认值\">原则一：正确的默认值</h3><p>组件的默认状态应该满足无障碍要求，无需消费者额外配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 不好的设计：默认没有焦点样式&#10;interface ButtonProps {&#10;  hideFocusRing?: boolean; // 给了一个&quot;错误选项&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 好的设计：默认有焦点样式，只有明确的设计决策才能覆盖&#10;interface ButtonProps {&#10;  // 不提供 hideFocusRing，或者在文档中明确说明后果&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不好的设计：默认没有焦点样式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hideFocusRing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 给了一个\"错误选项\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 好的设计：默认有焦点样式，只有明确的设计决策才能覆盖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 不提供 hideFocusRing，或者在文档中明确说明后果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"原则二-typescript-类型保障\">原则二：TypeScript 类型保障</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 图片组件：alt 是必填的，阻止消费者省略&#10;interface ImageProps {&#10;  src: string;&#10;  alt: string; // 必填，无默认值&#10;  width: number;&#10;  height: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 装饰性图片需要显式声明&#10;interface DecorativeImageProps {&#10;  src: string;&#10;  alt: &#39;&#39;; // 空字符串，明确声明装饰性&#10;  role: &#39;presentation&#39;;&#10;  width: number;&#10;  height: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 图标按钮：必须提供标签&#10;interface IconButtonProps {&#10;  icon: ReactNode;&#10;  &#39;aria-label&#39;: string; // 必填，防止无名称图标按钮&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 图片组件：alt 是必填的，阻止消费者省略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImageProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  src</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  alt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 必填，无默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 装饰性图片需要显式声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DecorativeImageProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  src</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  alt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 空字符串，明确声明装饰性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'presentation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 图标按钮：必须提供标签</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IconButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  icon</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReactNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'aria-label'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 必填，防止无名称图标按钮</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"原则三-语义透传\">原则三：语义透传</h3><p>复合组件的最终渲染 DOM 应该有正确的语义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CardProps {&#10;  as?: &#39;article&#39; | &#39;section&#39; | &#39;div&#39;;  // 允许消费者指定语义&#10;  children: ReactNode;&#10;  title?: string;  // 提供时自动渲染 heading&#10;}&#10;&#10;function Card({ as: Tag = &#39;article&#39;, title, children }: CardProps) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Tag&gt;&#10;      {title &amp;&amp; &lt;h3&gt;{title}&lt;/h3&gt;}&#10;      {children}&#10;    &lt;/Tag&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CardProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'article'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'section'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'div'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 允许消费者指定语义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReactNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 提供时自动渲染 heading</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">Tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'article'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#